---
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';

interface Props {
  stats: {
    posts: number;
    categories: number;
    tags: number;
    readingMinutes: number;
  };
}

const { stats } = Astro.props;
const about = siteConfig.pages.about;
const author = siteConfig.site.author;
---

<section id="about-page" class="creator-portfolio-shell">
  <!-- ========================================================
       1. 造物者身份总览展台 (Creator Hero Stage & Live Telemetry)
       ======================================================== -->
  <div class="creator-hero-card">
    <div class="creator-hero-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="creator-hero-body">
      <!-- 头像与动态呼吸光环 -->
      <div class="creator-avatar-wrap">
        <div class="creator-avatar-halo"></div>
        <div class="creator-avatar-inner">
          <img src={author.avatar} alt={author.name} class="creator-avatar-img" loading="eager" />
          <span class="creator-status-orb" title="状态：活跃中"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 身份标识与核心定位 -->
      <div class="creator-identity">
        <div class="creator-title-row">
          <h1 class="creator-name">{author.name}</h1>
          <span class="creator-alias">(世健)</span>
          <span class="creator-tag-badge">Builder & Architect</span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="creator-headline">
          {author.role}
        </p>

        <!-- 核心座右铭与精神信仰 -->
        <div class="creator-motto-banner">
          <div class="creator-motto-quote">
            <span class="motto-mark">“</span>
            <strong class="motto-text">{about.maxim.top}，{about.maxim.bottom}</strong>
            <span class="motto-mark">”</span>
          </div>
          <p class="motto-annotation">
            深潜底层，像隐秘水脉般打磨不可见的坚实地基；横贯广陆，以现代工程构建跨越时空的知识通衢。
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 实时遥测指标胶囊 -->
        <div class="creator-telemetry-bar">
          <div class="telemetry-pill">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
            <span>UTC-8 / PST (太平洋时区)</span>
          </div>

          <div class="telemetry-pill live-clock-pill">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
            <span id="about-live-clock">--:--:-- PST</span>
          </div>

          <div class="telemetry-pill status-pill">
            <span class="pulse-beacon"></span>
            <span>持续重构与深度写作中</span>
          </div>

          <div class="telemetry-pill tech-base-pill">
            <span class="tech-dot"></span>
            <span>Astro v6 · Edge D1 · Zero Cold Start</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================
       2. 核心定位：四大工程哲学罗盘 (Developer Compass)
       ======================================================== -->
  <div class="section-title-wrap">
    <span class="section-pill">01 / PHILOSOPHY</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">四大造物维度与工程罗盘</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">以此确立个人技术追求的坐标系，在复杂多变的技术潮水中锚定长期主义与工匠精神。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="compass-grid">
    <div class="compass-card">
      <div class="compass-card__header">
        <div class="compass-icon architecture">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="compass-tag">ORDER & ROBUSTNESS</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="compass-title">系统秩序与长效架构</h3>
      <p class="compass-text">
        推崇不可变数据流与严格类型安全。把个人博客当作十年级软件产品构建，拒绝临时拼凑与一次性脚手架代码。
      </p>
      <div class="compass-features">
        <span>#清晰边界</span>
        <span>#类型守卫</span>
        <span>#架构整洁</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="compass-card">
      <div class="compass-card__header">
        <div class="compass-icon craft">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24"></path><path d="m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="compass-tag">ERGONOMICS & CRAFT</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="compass-title">人体工学与体验洁癖</h3>
      <p class="compass-text">
        严苛追求 60fps 丝滑动效、零布局位移 (CLS 0) 与亚像素级字距排版。视觉微交互与键盘流，处处关照读者的身心感知。
      </p>
      <div class="compass-features">
        <span>#亚像素精修</span>
        <span>#零回流闪烁</span>
        <span>#触感反馈</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="compass-card">
      <div class="compass-card__header">
        <div class="compass-icon literature">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="compass-tag">DEEP THINKING</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="compass-title">深度慢思考与长文归档</h3>
      <p class="compass-text">
        远离算法信息茧房与碎片快餐化投喂。以结构化长文深入拆解工程痛点与技术决策，让知识具备随时间复利增值的长效厚度。
      </p>
      <div class="compass-features">
        <span>#结构化长文</span>
        <span>#反碎片化</span>
        <span>#知识复利</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="compass-card">
      <div class="compass-card__header">
        <div class="compass-icon sovereignty">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="compass-tag">DATA SOVEREIGNTY</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="compass-title">开放网络与数据主权</h3>
      <p class="compass-text">
        坚守第一方数据完全自主，不依赖封闭中心化商业平台。基于开放 Web 标准、去中心化边缘分布式存储与无障碍语义落地。
      </p>
      <div class="compass-features">
        <span>#数据自主</span>
        <span>#边缘计算</span>
        <span>#开放互联</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================
       3. 工程技术栈三层全景控制台 (Engineering Stack Topology)
       ======================================================== -->
  <div class="section-title-wrap">
    <span class="section-pill">02 / CAPABILITY MATRIX</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">全栈工程架构与技术拓扑</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">从浏览器交互表现层、编译渲染管道到底层全球分布式边缘运算的全链路技术选型。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="topology-deck">
    <!-- 层级 1：客户端感知层 -->
    <div class="topology-tier">
      <div class="tier-badge-col">
        <span class="tier-number">01</span>
        <span class="tier-label">感知交互层</span>
        <span class="tier-sub">Client & UX</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-content-grid">
        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Astro 6</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">Islands 架构</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">极致静态优先渲染，按需注水交互岛屿，实现近乎 0kb 初始 JS 负载与闪电般的首屏加载速度。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">React 19</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">动态交互岛</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">承载实时留言互动、全局控制中心、账号偏好面板等高交互复杂状态，组件生命周期严谨可控。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">TypeScript</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">全链路类型守卫</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">严格类型约束，从 Content Collections 模式校验到 API 传输契约，全工程零类型妥协与重构保障。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Tailwind CSS v4</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">现代原子样式</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">自研设计系统变量融合，毫秒级原子化编译，打造极致统一的圆角、阴影、微对比度与多主题阶梯。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 层级 2：内容编译管道 -->
    <div class="topology-tier">
      <div class="tier-badge-col">
        <span class="tier-number">02</span>
        <span class="tier-label">排版编译管道</span>
        <span class="tier-sub">Content Engine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-content-grid">
        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">MDX & Shiki</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">代码高亮与动态渲染</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">双主题深浅自适应语法高亮，支持在 Markdown 中无缝内嵌富媒体、标签卡与可交互组件。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">KaTeX & Math</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">科学公式排版</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">基于编译期预渲染的高性能数学公式引擎，严谨呈现复杂的算法推导、数学证明与公式体系。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Mermaid & Markmap</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">知识拓扑图谱</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">支持在正文中以内联代码方式实时绘制时序图、系统架构图与可交互思维导图，降低认知复杂度。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">i18n 多语言引擎</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">多语种分块转译</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">自研长文分块语义无损翻译流水线，支持 6 种主流语言原生路由切换与账号中心偏好持久化绑定。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 层级 3：全球分布式边缘底座 -->
    <div class="topology-tier">
      <div class="tier-badge-col">
        <span class="tier-number">03</span>
        <span class="tier-label">分布式边缘底座</span>
        <span class="tier-sub">Edge & Cloud</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-content-grid">
        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Cloudflare Pages</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">全球 Anycast 边缘</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">跨越全球 300+ 城市的边缘节点无感分发，实现全网极速直出与 100% 高可用抵御能力。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Cloudflare D1</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">边缘分布式 SQLite</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">边缘毫秒读写原生留言数据、点赞与用户活动流，彻底消除中心化跨大西洋数据库网络往返延迟。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">Cloudflare Workers</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">Serverless 无冷启动</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">承载 Telegram 实时推送、防滥用频次限流、属地 IP 识别与无头 API 路由，毫秒级轻盈处理。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-block">
          <div class="tech-block__head">
            <strong class="tech-name">GitOps 流水线</strong>
            <span class="tech-role">多远端同步协同</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tech-desc">每次单步提交自动同步多源仓库（GitHub / Cloudflare Pages），构建时自动化运行全栈测试审计。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================
       4. 数字花园运行数据看板 (Garden Telemetry)
       ======================================================== -->
  <div class="section-title-wrap">
    <span class="section-pill">03 / TELEMETRY</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">数字花园运行度量指标</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">用严谨的数据量化创作历程与站点运行效率，保持透明与沉淀。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="garden-telemetry-grid">
    <div class="telemetry-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">{stats.posts}</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">原创深度博文</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">覆盖系统架构、前端工程与实践思考</span>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">{stats.categories}</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">体系化专题分类</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">拆解技术层次，杜绝孤立信息孤岛</span>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"></path><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"></line></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">{stats.tags}</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">精准知识标签</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">多维交织的知识图谱与技术索引</span>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">{stats.readingMinutes}m</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">沉淀阅读分钟</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">数百小时深度思考与长文推敲累积</span>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-card highlight-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">100 / 100</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">Lighthouse 极速评分</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">Performance · Accessibility · Best Practices</span>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-card highlight-card">
      <div class="telemetry-card__icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-card__val">&lt; 30ms</div>
      <strong class="telemetry-card__title">全球边缘 TTFB 延迟</strong>
      <span class="telemetry-card__note">Cloudflare Anycast 边缘覆盖 300+ 节点</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================
       5. 造物初心与数字工匠宣言 (The Digital Craftsman Manifesto)
       ======================================================== -->
  <div class="section-title-wrap">
    <span class="section-pill">04 / MANIFESTO</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">数字工匠宣言与建站初心</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">为什么在快餐信息与算法喧嚣的时代，依然坚持用双手打造一座属于自己的数字花园？</p>
  </div>

  <div class="manifesto-chamber">
    <div class="manifesto-lead-box">
      <div class="manifesto-lead-tag">CREATIVE CREED</div>
      <h3 class="manifesto-lead-title">
        在算法喧嚣的时代，构筑一座属于自己的数字花园。
      </h3>
      <p class="manifesto-lead-desc">
        不迎合瞬息万变的快餐式热点，用代码与文字沉淀可穿越周期的长效价值。代码是建筑的筋骨，文字是思想的肌理，每一处留白与微交互都是对工匠精神的践行。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-triad">
      <div class="manifesto-triad-item">
        <div class="triad-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
        </div>
        <strong class="triad-title">性能即尊严</strong>
        <p class="triad-text">
          拒绝冗余的脚本依赖与无节制的运行时重绘。用精炼纯净的架构尊重读者的每一兆字节流量与每一次点击等待。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto-triad-item">
        <div class="triad-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <strong class="triad-title">清晰胜于聪明</strong>
        <p class="triad-text">
          拒绝晦涩难解的黑魔法写法，拥抱直观自明的系统契约。让系统在历经数年演进后依然能被轻松维护与优雅扩展。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto-triad-item">
        <div class="triad-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <strong class="triad-title">持续生长的常青树</strong>
        <p class="triad-text">
